   \[ E^\circ = 1.1416 \text{ V} - \frac{0.0591}{2} \log 0.01 \]  
   \[ E^\circ = 1.1416 \text{ V} - 0.0295 \times (-1) \]  
   \[ E^\circ = 1.1416 \text{ V} + 0.0295 \text{ V} = 1.1711 \text{ V} \]  

