   - **Pallidium-based catalysts (e.g., Pt/Pd, Pt/Pd/Pd)**: These are highly effective for hydrogenation and can be used with D₂ gas to produce deuterated alkanins.
   - **Nickel-based catalysts (e.g., Ni/Pd)**: These are also suitable for hydrogenation and can be used with D₂ gas to produce deuterated alanings.

