\[
\sqrt{(3 - p)^2 + (m - 0)^2} = 5 \implies (3 - p)^2 + m^2 = 25 \implies (3 - p)^2 + 6p = 25.
\]
Squaring $3 - p$, we get $9 - 6p + p^2 + 6p = 25 \implies p^2 + 9 = 25 \implies p^2 = 16 \implies p = pm \pm 4$. Since $p > 0$, $p = 4$.

