\[
a_1 = 3a_2
\]

The volume of the first cube is \( V_1 = a_1^3 = 27 \). The volume of the second cube is \( V_2 = a_2^3 \).

Since \( a_1 = 3a_2 \), we substitute this into the volume formula for the first cube:
\[
V_1 = (3a_2)^3 = 27a_3
\]
Since \( V_1 = 27 \), we have:
\[
