\[
g_n = \frac{(6.6743 \times 10^{-11})(5.9761 \times 10^{24})}{(6371.21 \times 10^3)^2} \left(1 - \frac{(6362.121 \times 10^3)^2}{(6371.21 \times 10^3)^2}\right)
\]

