     \[
     h = \frac{Nu \cdot k}{L}
     \]  
     For air at 500°C, \( k = 0.00023 \, \text{W/m·K} \).  
     \[
     h = \frac{1.009 \times 10^5 \times 0.00023}{0.2} = 111.01 \, \text{W/m}^2 \text{K}
     \]  

