\[
\Delta S_{\text{water}} = m_{\text{water}} \ln \left( \frac{T_{\text{vaporized}}}{T_{\text{initial}}} \right) + \Delta H_{\text{latent}}
\]

Since the heat transfer is irreversible, the entropy change of the system is:

\[
\Delta S_{\text{total}} = \Delta S_{\text{gas}} + \Delta S_{\text{water}}
\]

